4:Tce4,<h1>BNB Smart Chain Staking Guide 2026: How to Earn Passive Income with WOLV</h1>
<p>Staking on BNB Smart Chain has become one of the most accessible ways to generate passive income from digital assets. With low transaction fees, fast block times, and a thriving DeFi ecosystem, BNB Smart Chain (BSC) offers a compelling environment for both new and experienced investors.</p>
<p>WolvCapital is a U.S. regulated investment platform built on top of BNB Smart Chain, distributing rewards through the WOLV token — a BEP-20 token with a fixed supply of 1,000,000,000 WOLV, 60% of which is allocated to the reward pool.</p>
<h2>What Is BNB Smart Chain Staking?</h2>
<p>Staking refers to the process of locking digital assets into a protocol for a defined period in exchange for rewards. On BNB Smart Chain, this is done via smart contracts — transparent, immutable code deployed on-chain that can be verified by anyone.</p>
<p>WolvCapital's staking contracts are publicly verifiable on BSCScan:</p>
<ul>
<li><strong>WOLV Token</strong>: <a href="https://bscscan.com/token/0xe0167279aef7bf4ad313d261da82e8366822270c">0xe0167279...6822270c</a></li>
<li><strong>Staking Contract</strong>: <a href="https://bscscan.com/address/0x4b62efee5695ed55cd362a0b818f4c5f9694322b#code">0x4b62efee...9694322b</a></li>
<li><strong>Reward Pool</strong>: <a href="https://bscscan.com/address/0xb233cf74b14abf9d9702d585c540030125599579#code">0xb233cf74...25599579</a></li>
</ul>
<h2>WolvCapital Staking Plans</h2>
<p>WolvCapital offers four staking tiers designed for different investor profiles:</p>
<table>
<thead>
<tr>
<th>Plan</th>
<th>APY</th>
<th>Duration</th>
<th>Min Investment</th>
</tr>
</thead>
<tbody>
<tr>
<td>Pioneer</td>
<td>8%</td>
<td>90 days</td>
<td>$100</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>Vanguard</td>
<td>12%</td>
<td>150 days</td>
<td>$1,000</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>Horizon</td>
<td>18%</td>
<td>180 days</td>
<td>$5,000</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>Summit VIP</td>
<td>25%</td>
<td>365 days</td>
<td>$15,000</td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
<p>Each plan distributes WOLV token rewards proportional to the investment amount and duration.</p>
<h2>How WOLV Rewards Work</h2>
<p>When you stake with WolvCapital, your rewards are calculated based on your investment amount and the plan's APY. Rewards are distributed in WOLV tokens — recorded permanently on the BNB blockchain.</p>
<p>The pre-listing reference price is $1.00 per WOLV. WolvCapital plans to list WOLV on PancakeSwap in Q3 2026, at which point the market price will be determined by supply and demand.</p>
<h2>Is BNB Smart Chain Staking Safe?</h2>
<p>All investments carry risk. Digital asset markets are volatile, and past performance does not guarantee future results. WolvCapital mitigates risk through:</p>
<ul>
<li>Manual off-chain review of all transactions</li>
<li>KYC and AML compliance for every account</li>
<li>256-bit SSL encryption</li>
<li>FinCEN MSB registration</li>
</ul>
<h2>Getting Started</h2>
<ol>
<li>Create an account at <a href="https://wolvcapital.com/accounts/signup">wolvcapital.com</a></li>
<li>Complete KYC verification</li>
<li>Deposit USDT or BTC</li>
<li>Select your staking plan</li>
</ol>
<p>Always review the <a href="/risk-disclosure">Risk Disclosure</a> and <a href="/terms-of-service">Terms of Service</a> before investing.</p>0:{"buildId":"XFNnDbK1pbjedPIdaeilz","rsc":["$","$1","c",{"children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"min-h-screen bg-white","children":[["$","$L2",null,{"id":"blog-article-jsonld","type":"application/ld+json","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"Article\",\"headline\":\"BNB Smart Chain Staking Guide 2026: How to Earn Passive Income with WOLV\",\"description\":\"Learn how BNB Smart Chain staking works, how WOLV token rewards are distributed on-chain, and how WolvCapital's verified staking plans generate 8%-25% APY.\",\"datePublished\":\"2026-05-01T00:00:00.000Z\",\"dateModified\":\"2026-05-01T00:00:00.000Z\",\"image\":\"/og-images/plans-og.png\",\"author\":[{\"@type\":\"Organization\",\"name\":\"WolvCapital\"}],\"publisher\":{\"@type\":\"Organization\",\"name\":\"WolvCapital\",\"url\":\"https://wolvcapital.com\"},\"mainEntityOfPage\":{\"@type\":\"WebPage\",\"@id\":\"https://wolvcapital.com/blog/bnb-smart-chain-staking-guide-2026\"}}"}}],["$","section",null,{"className":"pt-28 pb-10 bg-gray-50","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"container mx-auto px-4 lg:px-8 max-w-3xl","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"text-sm text-gray-500","children":[["$","$L3",null,{"href":"/blog","className":"hover:text-[#0b2f6b] transition","children":"Blog"}],["$","span",null,{"aria-hidden":true,"className":"mx-2","children":"/"}],["$","span",null,{"className":"text-gray-600","children":"Article"}]]}],["$","p",null,{"className":"text-sm text-gray-500","children":"2026-05-01"}],["$","h1",null,{"className":"mt-3 text-3xl sm:text-4xl md:text-5xl font-extrabold text-[#0b2f6b]","children":"BNB Smart Chain Staking Guide 2026: How to Earn Passive Income with WOLV"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"mt-4 text-base sm:text-lg text-gray-700","children":"Learn how BNB Smart Chain staking works, how WOLV token